{"title": "Ice (surface)", "pageid": 2025, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ice_(surface)", "categories": ["Surfaces", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the slippery ice surface. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ice (disambiguation)\">Ice (disambiguation)</a>.   </div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ice_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Ice_surface.png/300px-Ice_surface.png.webp, /w/images/2/2c/Ice_surface.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Ice (surface) image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Ice_surface.png/300px-Ice_surface.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Ice_surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Ice</b> is a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Area\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">area</a>. Created in numerous ways, it can knock <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a> anyone who travels over it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Difficult terrain - <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">movement speed</a> is halved and creatures may fall Prone.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Surface</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Prone\"> Condition: Prone </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can't move or take <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Actions</a>, <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reactions</a>, and has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li>\n<li>Attacks against a Prone creature have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> if they're made within 3 m (10 ft) of the creature.</li>\n<li>A Prone creature must spend half its <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png/23px-Movement_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resources#Movement_speed\" title=\"Resources\">Movement Speed</a> to stand up.</li>\n<li>Falling Prone immediately ends <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a>.</li>\n<li>If a creatures falls Prone on its turn, the turn immediately ends.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Difficult_Terrain\"> Condition: Difficult Terrain </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Whilst on surface</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> halved</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>Items:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Snowburst_Ring\" title=\"Snowburst Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Snowburst_Ring\" title=\"Snowburst Ring\">Snowburst Ring</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Ice\" title=\"Arrow of Ice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Ice\" title=\"Arrow of Ice\">Arrow of Ice</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<p>Spells and actions:\n</p>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r347748\"><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blade_of_Rime\" title=\"Blade of Rime\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Blade_of_Rime_Icon.webp/30px-Blade_of_Rime_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Blade_of_Rime_Icon.webp/45px-Blade_of_Rime_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Blade_of_Rime_Icon.webp/60px-Blade_of_Rime_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blade of Rime\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Blade_of_Rime_Icon.webp/30px-Blade_of_Rime_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Blade_of_Rime_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Blade_of_Rime\" title=\"Blade of Rime\">Blade of Rime</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chromatic_Orb:_Cold\" title=\"Chromatic Orb: Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp/30px-Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp/45px-Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp/60px-Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chromatic Orb: Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp/30px-Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Chromatic_Orb:_Cold\" title=\"Chromatic Orb: Cold\">Chromatic Orb: Cold</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst_(Cold)\" title=\"Death Burst (Cold)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/30px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/45px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/60px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Burst (Cold)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/30px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst_(Cold)\" title=\"Death Burst (Cold)\">Death Burst (Cold)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Explosive_Icicle\" title=\"Explosive Icicle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/im