\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Generic_Healing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Allergy:_Ice_Bloom\" title=\"Magic Allergy: Ice Bloom\">Magic Allergy: Ice Bloom</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere_(Launch)\" title=\"Otiluke's Freezing Sphere (Launch)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere_Launch_Icon.webp/30px-Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere_Launch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere_Launch_Icon.webp/45px-Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere_Launch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere_Launch_Icon.webp/60px-Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere_Launch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Otiluke's Freezing Sphere (Launch)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere_Launch_Icon.webp/30px-Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere_Launch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere_Launch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere_(Launch)\" title=\"Otiluke's Freezing Sphere (Launch)\">Otiluke's Freezing Sphere (Launch)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sleet_Storm\" title=\"Sleet Storm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp/30px-Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp/45px-Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp/60px-Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sleet Storm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp/30px-Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sleet_Storm\" title=\"Sleet Storm\">Sleet Storm</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sphere_of_Elemental_Balance:_Cold\" title=\"Sphere of Elemental Balance: Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp/30px-Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp/45px-Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp/60px-Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sphere of Elemental Balance: Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp/30px-Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Chromatic_Orb_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sphere_of_Elemental_Balance:_Cold\" title=\"Sphere of Elemental Balance: Cold\">Sphere of Elemental Balance: Cold</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Interactions\">Interactions</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Ice can be formed when many \"wet\" surfaces are exposed to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage. Ice formed this way lasts for 2 turns and melts into water afterwards. These surfaces include:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Blood (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Blood (surface)\">Blood</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Water_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Water_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\">Water</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(surface)\" title=\"Alcohol (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Alcohol_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Alcohol_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Alcohol_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Alcohol_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Alcohol_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alcohol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Alcohol_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Alcohol_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(surface)\" title=\"Alcohol (surface)\">Alcohol</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_(surface)\" title=\"Acid (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_(surface)\" title=\"Acid (surface)\">Acid</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Simple_Toxin_(surface)\" title=\"Simple Toxin (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Simple_Toxin_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Simple_Toxin_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Simple_Toxin_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Simple_Toxin_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Simple_Toxin_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Simple_Toxin_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Simple Toxin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Simple_Toxin_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Simple_Toxin_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Simple_Toxin_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Simple_Toxin_(surface)\" title=\"Simple Toxin (surface)\">Simple Toxin</a> and other coatings</li></ul></li>\n<li>Ice melts into <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Water_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Water_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\">Water</a> when exposed to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage.</li>\n<li>Ice surfaces created (by any method) on top of existing surfaces behave differently from those made on normal ground. Ice surfaces on normal ground instantly trigger a saving throw to fall Prone on creation, while those made on other surfaces do not.\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Blood (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Blood_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Blood_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_(surface)\" title=\"Blood (surface)\">Blood</a> surfaces are produced by most instances of <a href=\"/wiki/Physical_damage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Physical damage\">physical damage</a>, so to ensure that creatures make an initial save to fall Prone when creating an ice surface beneath them, avoid dealing physical damage.</li></ul></li></ul>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When an ice surface is made through converting another surface with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage or by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Snowburst_Ring\" title=\"Snowburst Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Ring_A_Gem_A_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Snowburst_Ring\" title=\"Snowburst Ring\">Snowburst Ring</a>, it uses the attacker's <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell save DC\">spell save DC</a> (i.e., the spell save DC of their newest class). When created by a spell, it uses the spell save DC of the class to which the spell belongs (i.e., Intelligence-based spells use Intelligence for the spell save DC). The exception is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sleet_Storm\" title=\"Sleet Storm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp/20px-Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp/30px-Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp/40px-Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sleet Storm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp/20px-Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Sleet_Storm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sleet_Storm\" title=\"Sleet Storm\">Sleet Storm</a>, which always uses the spell save DC of the caster's newest class.</li>\n<li>A creature slipping on an ice surface attributes the source of the Prone condition to the character that formed the ice surface. This can trigger the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour\" title=\"Boots of Stormy Clamour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boots_of_Stormy_Clamour\" title=\"Boots of Stormy Clamour\">Boots of Stormy Clamour</a> and similar effects.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Ice\" title=\"Arrow of Ice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Arrow_of_Ice_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Ice\" title=\"Arrow of Ice\">Arrow of Ice</a> uses a fixed DC 12 save to avoid becoming Prone for any creature in range of the <i>initial</i> hit. This is a different save from the Dexterity save of the ice surface left behind afterwards, which behaves as a non-spell-created ice surface and uses the spell save DC of the attacker's newest class.</li>\n<li>If a creature succeeds on the saving throw to fall Prone, it can walk up to 4 m (13 ft) before triggering the next saving throw.</li>\n<li>If an ice surface is created on top of another surface, the first saving throw is only triggered after more than 1 m (3 ft) of movement.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 180px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 178px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Surface_Grass_Paving_Ice.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"An ice surface on a grassy, paved path at dusk.\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Surface_Grass_Paving_Ice.jpg/267px-Surface_Grass_Paving_Ice.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Surface_Grass_Paving_Ice.jpg/400px-Surface_Grass_Paving_Ice.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Surface_Grass_Paving_Ice.jpg/534px-Surface_Grass_Paving_Ice.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"An ice surface on a grassy, paved path at dusk.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Surface_Grass_Paving_Ice.jpg/267px-Surface_Grass_Paving_Ice.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"178\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Surface_Grass_Paving_Ice.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><i>An ice surface on a grassy, paved path at dusk.</i></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 122px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ice_Surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"An ice surface as seen in the prologue.\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Ice_Surface.png/180px-Ice_Surface.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Ice_Surface.png/270px-Ice_Surface.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Ice_Surface.png/360px-Ice_Surface.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"An ice surface as seen in the prologue.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Ice_Surface.png/180px-Ice_Surface.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Ice_Surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><i>An ice surface as seen in the prologue.</i></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194828\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.167 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.179 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8957/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 98574/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 25516/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3014/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.064/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1153930/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  145.639      1 -total\n 99.59%  145.036      1 Template:Area_page\n 33.07%   48.156     25 Template:Icon_link\n 32.65%   47.554     26 Template:Icon_text\n 29.78%   43.365     96 Template:Trim\n 15.66%   22.808     14 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 15.20%   22.137      5 Template:Item_icon\n 14.36%   20.917      5 Template:Area\n 14.30%   20.833     36 Template:Ifempty\n 13.19%   19.214      2 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:2025-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714194828 and revision id 371592. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}